OL,3,GNEWSAHusband who plotted wife's murder 
OL,4,Aloses appeal bid                       
OL,6,FA man jailed for hiring a hitman to    
OL,7,Fmurder his wife has lost a bid to      
OL,8,Fappeal against his conviction.         
OL,10,FCarol Morgan, 36, was found dead at the
OL,11,Fcouple's shop in Leighton Buzzard,     
OL,12,FBedfordshire on 13 August 1981.        
OL,14,FHer then husband, Allen Morgan, was    
OL,15,Fconvicted of conspiracy to murder in   
OL,16,FJuly 2024 and jailed for life with a   
OL,17,Fminimum term of nearly 22 years. The   
OL,18,Fkiller has never been identified.      
