OL,4,Aloses appeal bid                       
OL,6,FAt the Court of Appeal, his lawyers    
OL,7,Ftried to argue that the jury in his    
OL,8,Fcriminal trial was allowed to hear     
OL,9,Fevidence that was "inherently          
OL,10,Funreliable".                           
